  "content": "<p>在 Minecraft 中擴展你的裝飾可能性，使用<strong>地毯變體</strong>模組。這個模組讓你不僅能將地毯鋪在地板上，還能掛在牆壁和天花板上。透過使用地毯裝飾任何表面，創造獨特的室內設計，並凸顯你家的風格。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/887/721/1.png\" alt=\"截圖\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1035201.svg\" alt=\"版本\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/thomasglasser/thomasglasser/blob/main/files/badges/cozy/supported/neoforge_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"neoforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_64h.png\" alt=\"fabric\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_64h.png\" alt=\"quilt\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_64h.png\" alt=\"forge\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcarpet-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ludwici\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"patreon-singular\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fludwici\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_64h.png\" alt=\"kofi-singular\"></a></p><p>查看我的其他模組：</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-deco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/8c2kJqYK/copperdeco125.png\" alt=\"銅製裝飾\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-loot-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n1X16BM.png\" alt=\"生物掉落變體\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-block-sounds-fork\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/epM9STT.png\" alt=\"更好的方塊音效\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slime-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/7LPXcWkr/so-logo-mini.png\" alt=\"史萊姆大修\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polyglot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/d3RCh0RZ/polyglot-mini.jpg\" alt=\"多語言\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/hytale/mods/weapon-mastery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/C1fM4HHC/WM125.jpg\" alt=\"武器大師\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/big-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/NMB0gG5S/icon.png\" alt=\"大水域\"></a></p>",
